cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "KAMAR-META-AGENT: Evidence-Aware AI Audit Framework"
message: "If you use this software or architectural framework in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Djebassi"
    given-names: "Mounir"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-6871-7693"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Constantine, Algeria"
repository-code: "https://github.com/djebassimounir-dev/kamar-meta-agent"
url: "https://github.com/djebassimounir-dev/kamar-meta-agent"
abstract: >-
  KAMAR-META-AGENT is a prototype framework for structurally reviewing outputs from AI agents.
  It checks evidence references, reports declared contradictions, inspects execution traces,
  verifies artifact hashes using SHA-256, and includes a tamper-evident SQLite token ledger
  with HMAC-protected records.
keywords:
  - "AI Auditing "
  - " Multi- Agent Systems "
  - " Evidence-Aware Inspection "
  - " Execution Trace Verification "
  - " Artifact Integrity "
  - " LLM Reliability "
